      "observed": "The root sheet contains an unlisted 74LVC1G08 AND gate (U5). Its inputs (pins 1 and 2) are connected to global labels NFC_SDA and NFC_SCL, and its output (pin 4) is connected to global label NFC_INT. The NFC_INT net is also driven by U3 pin 4 (FD) and pulled up by R3.",
