          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "NFC_INT net: U2 pin 22 (PA6) — R3 (10 kΩ) to VCC — U3 pin 4 (FD)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The AND gate will drive NFC_INT high whenever both SDA and SCL are high, and low when either is low, overriding the actual field-detect signal. This causes spurious interrupts to the MCU and possible contention with U3's open-drain FD output, risking damage.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic contains an extra, unlisted 74LVC1G08 AND gate on the root sheet that bridges NFC_SDA and NFC_SCL into the NFC_INT net, conflicting with the intended open-drain field-detect signal from U3."
}

